# {{.ProjectName}}

This is a Spring Boot Monolith Layered API project generated with `api-kit`.

## Requirements
- Java 17+
- Maven 3.6+

## Run
To run the application locally:
```bash
mvn spring-boot:run
```

## Build
To compile and package the application into a fat JAR:
```bash
mvn clean package
```
The compiled JAR will be located in the `target/` directory.

## Endpoints
- `GET /items`
- `POST /items`
